<title>HONG KONG: First Merchant Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>First Merchant Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Shinhan Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER FIRST MERCHANT BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON     6ML+55 BP  MATURITY 5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH   03.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	   CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES  21.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS US$250K</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	   SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE 07.APR.97</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	   LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN+   30 BP ALL-IN 65 BP</p>
<p>	   SENIOR MANAGERS US$3-4 MLN  24 BP ALL-IN 63 BP</p>
<p>	   MANAGERS	  US$1-2 MLN  18 BP ALL-IN 61 BP</p>
<p> ARRANGERS DRESDNER SEA, KDB INTERNATIONAL SINGAPORE AND SHINHAN</p>
<p>	     BANK</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
